Fact.Description:
IRC §1222 — short-term (held ≤1 year) vs long-term (held >1 year).
        Form 8949 Part I = short-term;
        Part II = long-term (Form 8949 instr. (2025) p.3).

shortTerm → Form 8949 Part I / Schedule D Part I;
        longTerm → Form 8949 Part II / Schedule D Part II.
        IRC §1222.

Box A or G — both total to the same Schedule D line (Schedule D 2025 line labels;
        Form 8949 instr.
        (2025) pp.3–4: G is the digital-asset/1099-DA counterpart of A).

Box B or H — both total to the same Schedule D line (Schedule D 2025 line labels;
        Form 8949 instr.
        (2025) pp.3–4: H is the digital-asset/1099-DA counterpart of B).

Box C or I — both total to the same Schedule D line (Schedule D 2025 line labels;
        Form 8949 instr.
        (2025) pp.3–4: I is the digital-asset/1099-DA counterpart of C).

Box D or J — both total to the same Schedule D line (Schedule D 2025 line labels;
        Form 8949 instr.
        (2025) pp.3–4: J is the digital-asset/1099-DA counterpart of D).

Box E or K — both total to the same Schedule D line (Schedule D 2025 line labels;
        Form 8949 instr.
        (2025) pp.3–4: K is the digital-asset/1099-DA counterpart of E).

Box F or L — both total to the same Schedule D line (Schedule D 2025 line labels;
        Form 8949 instr.
        (2025) pp.3–4: L is the digital-asset/1099-DA counterpart of F).
